cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "denckring: a library of experimental writing procedures"
message: "If you use this software or its catalogue, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: senzelden
    email: dennis.senzel@posteo.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/senzelden/denckring"
url: "https://senzelden.github.io/denckring/"
abstract: >-
  A Python library of experimental writing procedures — lipograms, snowballs,
  sestinas and several hundred more — in which every procedure pairs a generator
  with a validator, so the acceptance criterion is intrinsic rather than
  invented. Ships a catalogue of sourced procedures as CC BY 4.0 open data,
  each entry recording how its attribution was established and whether the
  procedure admits a mechanical check at all.
keywords:
  - oulipo
  - constrained writing
  - computational poetics
  - digital humanities
  - natural language processing
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
version: 0.1.0
